# Keep the Docker build context small: only server/, init-nested-submodules.sh and
# the .gitmodules files are used by the Dockerfile.
#
# .clusterfuzzlite/ is deliberately NOT listed: ClusterFuzzLite builds its image from this
# same context and COPYs .clusterfuzzlite/build.sh, so ignoring it breaks the fuzz build.
.github
docs
frontend
scripts
**/node_modules
**/build
**/build-*
server/data
*.md
